# Markdown is the durable content layer in this workspace — never reformat it.
#
# Prettier normalizes `*emphasis*` to `_emphasis_` and escapes bare asterisks
# (`/vc-*` becomes `/vc-\*`). On docs/plans/notes that is silent corruption:
# the text still reads, but the original wording is altered and the diff is
# noise. It corrupted 11 files in 04-vibe-chat on 2026-09-25.
#
# Shared workspace policy (04-vibe-chat/.prettierignore — same rationale).
*.md
